title":"","content":"About the Psiads:<br /> <br /> 1) All Psiads can choose +1 PSI instead of +1 Attribute in the Step Six?<br /> <br /> 2) Psions gains 4 mode dots (3 primary modes dots plus 1 free mode dot) in the character creation, Psiads gains the same 4 mode dots (3 primary modes dots, at least one dot to each Aptitude, plus 1 free mode dot)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T07:07:29-07:00","id":1336204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336193#post1336193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About the Psiads:<br /> <br /> 1) All Psiads can choose +1 PSI instead of +1 Attribute in the Step Six?<br /> <br /> 2) Psions gains 4 mode dots (3 primary modes dots plus 1 free mode dot) in the character creation, Psiads gains the same 4 mode dots (3 primary modes dots, at least one dot to each Aptitude, plus 1 free mode dot)?</div> </div> </div> </div>1) Page 85: \u201cNote that psiads do not gain an additional dot to one Attribute in her preferred Approach as they have not been enhanced by the Prometheus Chamber.\u201d As I read, they don\u2019t get the dot that they could trade for Psi<br /> <br /> 2) As I understand you are correct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T08:05:15-07:00","id":1336215,"title":"","content":"1) I think the Prometheus Chamber Attribute bonus happens in the step 5, the +1 PSI Bonus happens in the Step 6: Finishing Touchs of the Psions (Aeon, pg 121) and in place of the Attribute bonus from Step 6: Finishing Touchs in the Core (pg 38).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T08:54:32-07:00","id":1336219,"title":"","content":"\u201cGain bonus traits (Trinity Continuum Corebook, p. XX), and calculate Health and Defense rating.\u201d<br /> <br /> So we follow as in Core not Aeon. 1 Attribute point in any, 4 Edges and possibly experience. I believe it\u2019s not possible to trade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T11:11:57-07:00","id":1336248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336219#post1336219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cGain bonus traits (Trinity Continuum Corebook, p. XX), and calculate Health and Defense rating.\u201d<br /> <br /> So we follow as in Core not Aeon. 1 Attribute point in any, 4 Edges and possibly experience. I believe it\u2019s not possible to trade.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the Aeon, pg 121: &quot;Gain bonus traits (Trinity Continuum Corebook, p. 38), and calculate Health and Defense rating. Characters who are quantakinetics or teleporters or who possess a quantakinesis or teleportation Auxiliary Mode (see below) must forgo the additional Attribute dot provided in this section and instead increase their starting Psi trait to 3. Players of characters with other Aptitudes are also free to forgo the bonus Attribute dot to start play with a Psi trait of 3, but do not need to do so.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T11:14:04-07:00","id":1336249,"title":"","content":"In the Aeon specify the source of this trade (+1 PSI in the place of 1 Attribute dot in the Step 6, not in the Step 5). The attribute bonus from the Prometheus Chamber happens in the Step 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T11:42:19-07:00","id":1336255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336249#post1336249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the Aeon specify the source of this trade (+1 PSI in the place of 1 Attribute dot in the Step 6, not in the Step 5). The attribute bonus from the Prometheus Chamber happens in the Step 5.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really was thinking in the other attribute, but my last post I was thinking correctly.<br /> <br /> But in Aeon it says you can do it, and for Psiads it doesn\u2019t say anything about the trade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T13:20:18-07:00","id":1336293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336193#post1336193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About the Psiads:<br /> <br /> 1) All Psiads can choose +1 PSI instead of +1 Attribute in the Step Six?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, psiads can\u2019t trade for more Psi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:15:48-07:00","id":1336307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336107#post1336107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm actually really glad that the Superiors are stated up with their own power system rather then using notes like &quot;Superiors have Mega-Attributes and Mega-Edges&quot;. Instead they created new Powers using a dot system which is awesome. That power system, though needing more individual powers as everything needs more powers, is too me spectacularly amazingly awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div> With all due respect, Mega-Edges <i>are</i> \u201cpowers using a dot system\u201d. To me, the Superior powers, even as presented in \u00c6on \u00c6xpansion, are Mega-Edges in all but name; and even mechanically, a Superior can be thought of as \u201ca tier 2 \u2018nova\u2019 that's restricted to a subset of the Mega-Edges\u201d: no Quantum Powers, no Mega-Attributes even; and if they <i>have</i> a Quantum rating, they don't <i>use</i> it \u2014 so there's no point putting it on the character sheet. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336107#post1336107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That said I am also a fan of the fact that Psiads are actually statted up by saying &quot;just use Aeon for powers&quot; since rewriting a whole hundred pages of noetic powers seem like a waste.</div> </div> </div> </div> For TC:\u00c6, yes. For TC:Ab, it makes it impossible to include psiads without also buying TC:\u00c6. Which is why I'm in favor of a TC:Ab supplement that includes rules for psiads, and either reproduce the relevant Aptitudes from TC:\u00c6 or (more likely) show how to adapt the Quantum Powers and Mega-Edges mechanics from TC:Ab to represent noetic powers. <br /> <br /> Likewise, I'm hoping that TC:A! will include mechanics for Stalwarts and Mesmerists which are basically \u201chow to adapt the Talents rules to represent Quantum and Psi\u201d. I don't want to have to use \u00c6on \u00c6xpansion's Psiad and Superior rules, or TC:Ab's rules, to represent Mesmerists and Stalwarts. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336107#post1336107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unrelated but related I do have to say I wish we had more Mega-Edges because there seem to be areas that the old 1e Enhancements covered that 2de doesn't, and that is a pity as those categories were brilliant to me. I LOVED going through the Enhancement chapter and getting new ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:23:34-07:00","id":1336308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336293#post1336293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, psiads can\u2019t trade for more Psi.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks Bunyip!!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:39:40-07:00","id":1336315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336307#post1336307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> and if they <i>have</i> a Quantum rating, they don't <i>use</i> it \u2014 so there's no point putting it on the character sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>They don\u2019t have a Quantum rating. It\u2019s not just that they don\u2019t use it so don\u2019t bother putting it on the sheet, they don\u2019t have one. If they did, they\u2019d not be able to use bioapps - they\u2019d kill them instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:43:32-07:00","id":1336317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336307#post1336307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Likewise, I'm hoping that TC:A! will include mechanics for Stalwarts and Mesmerists which are basically \u201chow to adapt the Talents rules to represent Quantum and Psi\u201d. I don't want to have to use \u00c6on \u00c6xpansion's Psiad and Superior rules, or TC:Ab's rules, to represent Mesmerists and Stalwarts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Psiads aren\u2019t Mesmerists, and Superiors aren\u2019t precisely Stalwarts*. There may be similarities, but no one is looking to limit where Adventure! wants to go by forcing it to bring psiad/superior rules in as is. <br /> <br /> * Adventure! Isn\u2019t even in 1st drafts yet. We don\u2019t know what Mesmerists and stalwarts will look like and how similar/different they\u2019ll be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:46:16-07:00","id":1336318,"title":"","content":"One main thing is that I am really looking forward to Adventure! While setting wise it wasn't my favorite I did LOVE the powers in that splat.<br /> <br /> So yeah when they appear its going to be glorious.<br /> <br /> I agree that there are certain thematic similarities between Superior Powers and Nova powers all I was saying is that I really like the fact that they choose to create a new power set rather than simply state &quot;use this list of Mega-Attributes and Mega-Edges to represent Superiors&quot;. It might save space but its not fun.<br /> <br /> What I also really like is how clean cut and organized and structured the Powers of Superiors are. I LOVE that style of power system. <br /> <br /> I just wish that the Mega-Edges of Aberrant were as structured, though I do have hope that once they go through the various editing passes then some of the issues that made the Mega-Edges a bit of a mess in the Aberrant book will be fixed. Though I do have to add I am sad that some of the Enhancements of 1e didn't come back as I LOVED that category of ability. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 09-17-2019, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:46:56-07:00","id":1336319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336315#post1336315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They don\u2019t have a Quantum rating. It\u2019s not just that they don\u2019t use it so don\u2019t bother putting it on the sheet, they don\u2019t have one. If they did, they\u2019d not be able to use bioapps - they\u2019d kill them instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t know if it\u2019s the case, but it sounds like Q1 is roughly like Psi 6 (when you became a tier 3 character). Before you reach Q1 you are still \u201chuman enough\u201d to have a psi score and use Noetic items. Superiors are on this gap, they deal with quantum but not enough to reach the minimum of the scale.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T14:57:14-07:00","id":1336324,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Superiors not really being Stalwarts (which make sense) are Talents actually modern day Daredevils? Is what we have how they work both back them and now and such? <br /> <br /> Also, speaking of Talents, they still have a Psi score, right? <br /> <br /> Oh, and speaking of Psaids, maybe I missed it (no, I know I did) but what Psi rating do they start at? Is it 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T15:11:03-07:00","id":1336332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336324#post1336324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of Superiors not really being Stalwarts (which make sense) are Talents actually modern day Daredevils? Is what we have how they work both back them and now and such?</div> </div> </div> </div>Presumably, but yet to be confirmed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, speaking of Talents, they still have a Psi score, right? </div> </div> </div>If it becomes relevant, they have Psi 1, just like every other normal human.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Oh, and speaking of Psaids, maybe I missed it (no, I know I did) but what Psi rating do they start at? Is it 2? </div> </div> </div>Yes, Psi 2. It was implied but not specifically stated, sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T16:25:32-07:00","id":1336362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336318#post1336318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One main thing is that I am really looking forward to Adventure! While setting wise it wasn't my favorite I did LOVE the powers in that splat.<br /> <br /> So yeah when they appear its going to be glorious.</div> </div> </div> </div>I certainly hope and expect so. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336318#post1336318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree that there are certain thematic similarities between Superior Powers and Nova powers all I was saying is that I really like the fact that they choose to create a new power set rather than simply state &amp;quot;use this list of Mega-Attributes and Mega-Edges to represent Superiors&amp;quot;. It might save space but its not fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>It wouldn't save space; it would require you to buy TC:Ab to use it. All I'm saying is that you could get a really good approximation of a Superior using the Nova rules by calling them a Tier 2 variation on Novas who just have Mega-Edges. Which brings me to: <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336318#post1336318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I also really like is how clean cut and organized and structured the Powers of Superiors are. I LOVE that style of power system. <br /> <br /> I just wish that the Mega-Edges of Aberrant were as structured, though I do have hope that once they go through the various editing passes then some of the issues that made the Mega-Edges a bit of a mess in the Aberrant book will be fixed. Though I do have to add I am sad that some of the Enhancements of 1e didn't come back as I LOVED that category of ability.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't mind the Mega-Edges being better organized; I think you could easily manage a \u201cPhysical Mega-Edges, Mental Mega-Edges, Social Mega-Edges\u201d grouping that mirrors the way Superior powers are organized. As for the shortage of Mega-Edges, the parallel between Novas and Superiors works both ways: if there are any Superior powers that don't have Mega-Edge counterparts, you can create Mega-Edge counterparts. I haven't yet done a side-by-side compare and contrast yet; but I suspect that the differences between them are mainly that Mega-Edges are more powerful and generally have prerequisites.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T17:09:51-07:00","id":1336382,"title":"","content":"1) <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336193#post1336193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About the Psiads:<br /> <br /> 2) Psions gains 4 mode dots (3 primary modes dots plus 1 free mode dot) in the character creation, Psiads gains the same 4 mode dots (3 primary modes dots, at least one dot to each Aptitude, plus 1 free mode dot)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Can we get clarification on this? The Psiad template doesn't say anything about an extra free Mode dot, so I don't know where you're getting this from. <br /> <br /> I feel like the Psiad template needs to be clarified overall, actually. It doesn't even state anywhere what your starting Psi is--it can be inferred from the Psi chart that it's 2, but it isn't explicit anywhere.The template seems to be assuming that we're going to be using the Psion template as a base and modifying it for Psiads, but that is inevitably going to cause some confusion, as illustrated by this thread.<br /> <br /> 2) There are a LOT of typos in this book: &quot;their&quot; instead of &quot;they're,&quot; extra words in sentences, missing punctuation, etc. The Vehicles illustration even spells &quot;Qin&quot; as &quot;Quin.&quot; Are these going to be addressed?<br /> <br /> 3) I was hoping for more information on Super Science, because I'm still confused by a lot of it. The Core book says Talents can have (Wealth x2 + Inspiration) ranks of Advanced and Inspired items (not counting ones gained from the Artifact Edge), but obviously ignores Powered items since Talents can't make those. However, nothing says anything about what Psions can have. Do they include Powered items in this figure? I assume they replace Inspiration with Psi, right? Or is this limitation just totally ignored for Psions because Tolerance sorta covers it?<br /> <br /> The unique powers each VARG has are cool examples of Super Science items, though, and very helpful. Kudos to whomever came up with those. I especially love the Occlusion ability. <br /> <br /> 4) I will second those in this thread saying it wasn't obvious that Superiors are Quantum-based, but I'll counter that by saying I don't think it matters? They're artificial either way, and don't have any particular interactions with any power source since they don't have powers that can be affected by Quantakinesis or Quantum Disruption or whatever. They are definitely cool, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T18:02:52-07:00","id":1336398,"title":"","content":"1) this extra dot is for a total of 4 dots, same as the Psion (1 in each mode +1 extra)<br /> <br /> 2) this file is pre-errata. Feel free to point all the typos and concerns on the Errata form. <a href=\"https://forms.gle/K8R7yEESGvSaKqqB7\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/K8R7yEESGvSaKqqB7</a><br /> <br /> 3) Powered items can only be bought with the Artifact Edge. Psions, Psiads, Superiors and Novas don\u2019t gain extra inspired and Advanced Super Science items, they have the same number as regular people, no more than Wealth x2 ranks. The \u201cluck\u201d of getting more Advanced and Inspired items is part of the Talents general luck.<br /> There are a few examples of super science weapons in Aeon, basically only the Psi Glautlets.<br /> <br /> 4) In fact they could be powered down by QK, but only by the 7 dot power, as all the others affect only external powers (that Superiors don\u2019t have). So Bhurano can turn off a Superior. The question I leave here is can a Psion/Psiad/Nova detect a Superior as a Quantum Source, even a very week source as it don\u2019t leek from the superior body?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 09-17-2019, 09:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T18:20:09-07:00","id":1336406,"title":"","content":"Oh, and because I feel like I'm only ever complaining:<br /> <br /> 1) I do love the Psiads. The system here is very similar to a system I had mocked up for myself, so obviously it's brilliant <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> 2) I freaking LOVE the explanation about how formatting to a device allows you to control it mentally and sense through its sensors. That is super cool and makes biotech even more awesome than it already was, and opens up all sorts of cool stuff you can do. Biodrones are so cool! And I love all the stuff with formatted biocomps working to make users more comfortable and the potential impacts on biocities and everything. I'm usually bored by high-tech stuff, but this is all so new and exciting. <br /> <br /> 3) I know they're not from the Aexpansion, but I just love Qin bioblimps so much??? I'm basically picturing giant Gary Larson-esque floating cows, docile and happily munching on grass, and I refuse to accept any other mental image. I want more bio-creatures like these, please! I know every bit of biotech is technically &quot;alive,&quot; but I want more semi-autonomous, sentient biotech. And not to turn this into a cartoon, but I would honestly love ornery, cantankerous biotech that only likes certain people or gets snippy when it's not handled gently or whatever. I guess I could use the Living tag and Built-in Complication flaws... ooh, ideas...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T18:28:40-07:00","id":1336409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336398#post1336398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) this extra dot is for a total of 4 dots, same as the Psion (1 in each mode +1 extra)<br /> <br /> 2) this file is pre-errata. Feel free to point all the typos and concerns on the Errata form. <a href=\"https://forms.gle/K8R7yEESGvSaKqqB7\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/K8R7yEESGvSaKqqB7</a><br /> <br /> 3) Powered items can only be bought with the Artifact Edge. Psions, Psiads, Superiors and Novas don\u2019t gain extra inspired and Advanced Super Science items, they have the same number as regular people, no more than Wealth x2 ranks. The \u201cluck\u201d of getting more Advanced and Inspired items is part of the Talents general luck.<br /> There are a few examples of super science weapons in Aeon, basically only the Psi Glautlets.<br /> <br /> 4) In fact they could be powered down by QK, but only by the 7 dot power, as all the others affect only external powers (that Superiors don\u2019t have). So Bhurano can turn off a Superior. The question I leave here is can a Psion/Psiad/Nova detect a Superior as a Quantum Source, even a very week source as it don\u2019t leek from the superior body?</div> </div> </div> </div>1) What are you basing that on?<br /> 2) I'll start making a list, I guess. Isn't this why editors exist, though?<br /> 3) Yeah, the only examples of Super Science items so far are Psi Gauntlets and VARG powers. But, again, what are you basing your answer on? There are no rules anywhere supporting your answer one way or the other.<br /> 4) I doubt 7 dot powers are going to come up very often in-game! But I do concede that the possibility of detection needs to be addressed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T18:38:33-07:00","id":1336411,"title":"","content":"1) I swear I read 3 times and missed this. Is only 2 dots in one and 1 dot in the other aptitude, total 3.<br /> 2) You don\u2019t have to, but any help is welcomed. You need to add the info one by one, so feel free to make a list or add every time you find one, up to you.<br /> 3) it was commented by a dev in an Aberrant post some time ago when talking about Powers Items. But sure, there is nothing saying that. But there is nothing saying anything that goes against it too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T19:10:51-07:00","id":1336421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336411#post1336411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) I swear I read 3 times and missed this. Is only 2 dots in one and 1 dot in the other aptitude, total 3.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, cool, I was honestly worried I'd missed something in plain sight.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3) it was commented by a dev in an Aberrant post some time ago when talking about Powers Items. But sure, there is nothing saying that. But there is nothing saying anything that goes against it too. </div> </div> </div>And I swear I'm not trying to be annoying about this, because I understand what you're saying. But the Core book is very clear on how much Super Science Neutrals and Talents get and how they get it, and I haven't gone over the Aberrant book as much but it seems pretty clear on &quot;this is how you get Q-Tech and this is how much you get,&quot; but it's not addressed anywhere in Aeon or the Aexpansion. There's too much &quot;maybe it works this way?&quot; for me in the Psion system, which is why I'd like in-book clarification. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T20:26:03-07:00","id":1336441,"title":"","content":"Are the listed cybernetics with the Superior Origins things they get for free, in addition to whatever they buy with Cyberware Access, what they\u2019re allowed to buy with Cyberware Access, what they\u2019re required to buy with Cyberware access, or just suggestions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T22:05:03-07:00","id":1336491,"title":"","content":"From what I read about Psiads, they only get 3 dots to divide between the 6 modes of their two Primary Aptitudes at character generation. The reason Psions get a 4th dot is because of the improvements the Prometheus Chambers provide. This is the same reason why Psiads do not get a bonus Attribute dot for their preferred Approach (and thus can't sacrifice it to start the game with Psi 3 like Psions can).<br /> <br /> One thing I am not clear on is how Quantakinesis works with Psiads. I know that once they reach Psi 3, they treat it as a 3rd Primary Aptitude, but it isn't clear if they can purchase Quantakinetic modes before then (though it is clearly stated that they can not choose Teleportation modes until Psi 3). Since Psions who specialize in either Quantakinesis or Teleportation need to be Psi 3 to do so, I am inclined towards the idea that Quantakinetic modes can't be obtained until Psi 3 for Psiads, just like Teleportation modes. I think this makes the most sense overall to be honest.<br /> <br /> As for the rest of the PDF, I am still working my way through much of it. Still, I am looking forward to getting a physical copy of this product once a PoD is available (PDFs are okay, but my computer isn't really portable to my games).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T01:37:14-07:00","id":1336508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336398#post1336398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) this extra dot is for a total of 4 dots, same as the Psion (1 in each mode +1 extra)</div> </div> </div> </div>Psiads get three dots, not four.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T01:41:57-07:00","id":1336509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowstripe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336491#post1336491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I am not clear on is how Quantakinesis works with Psiads. I know that once they reach Psi 3, they treat it as a 3rd Primary Aptitude, but it isn't clear if they can purchase Quantakinetic modes before then (though it is clearly stated that they can not choose Teleportation modes until Psi 3).</div> </div> </div> </div>Below Psi 3, no psi user can take dots in QK or teleport. After Psi 3, psiads gain QK as a primary and can purchase dots - unless they\u2019re in a pre-AEon era, in which case they can\u2019t.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T02:01:36-07:00","id":1336513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336441#post1336441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the listed cybernetics with the Superior Origins things they get for free, in addition to whatever they buy with Cyberware Access, what they\u2019re allowed to buy with Cyberware Access, what they\u2019re required to buy with Cyberware access, or just suggestions?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they\u2019re free. I could be wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T07:04:02-07:00","id":1336546,"title":"","content":"In what book does the Edge Cyberware Access appear? I can extrapolate how it works, but I thought it was a new Edge when I saw it in the Aexpansion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T07:42:03-07:00","id":1336553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slagheap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336546#post1336546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In what book does the Edge Cyberware Access appear? I can extrapolate how it works, but I thought it was a new Edge when I saw it in the Aexpansion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aeon, page 130. It\u2019s the Nihonjin Agent Path Edge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 09-18-2019, 10:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T07:47:40-07:00","id":1336556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slagheap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336546#post1336546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In what book does the Edge Cyberware Access appear? I can extrapolate how it works, but I thought it was a new Edge when I saw it in the Aexpansion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aeon. Page 130. It is a path restricted Edge (Nihonjin Agent); though naturally the Superior Origin paths can also access it.<br /> <br /> Edit; seems a Nihonjin Agent got there before I did...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 09-18-2019, 10:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T08:08:41-07:00","id":1336559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336556#post1336556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit; seems a Nihonjin Agent got there before I did...</div> </div> </div> </div>Omaewa mou shindeiru.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T09:17:41-07:00","id":1336573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336509#post1336509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Below Psi 3, no psi user can take dots in QK or teleport. After Psi 3, psiads gain QK as a primary and can purchase dots - unless they\u2019re in a pre-AEon era, in which case they can\u2019t.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah... that was what I sort of settled on since it seemed like the most reasonable one. Quantakinetics and Teleportation are the two Aptitudes that require Psi 3 to learn, even for Psions, so it seemed most reasonable for Psiads to be similarly limited in the selection of those modes.<br /> <br /> On a similar note, I am curious about the base powers that Psiads get. While it is specifically stated that they do get the base powers of Quantakinesis (Psi Cloak and Subquantum Sense), it isn't quite as clear if they get any of the other base powers for Aptitudes they know modes for. Reading up on these base powers, it seems that Psions get access to them the moment they learn even a single Auxiliary mode in a given Aptitude... so judging by this, I would conclude that Psions would also gain these base powers too the moment they learned a dot in any Aptitude Mode. This means that a starting Psiad will likely have up to 6 base powers... the two they automatically get from Quantakinetics (even without a dot in that Aptitude's modes) and the two from their two selected Primary Modes (assuming that they divide their 3 dots between the two Primary Aptitudes; if they put all their dots into one Aptitude, then it seems likely that they only have the base powers of that single Aptitude).<br /> <br /> I do hope I am right about this... it seems the most logical interpretation of the rules as currently written.<br /> <br /> As a tangent... I am curious as to when interactive Trinity Continuum character sheet PDFs will become available... and if we will soon see variant Aeon character sheets for Psiads and Superiors... since they have significant alterations for character design that the standard Aeon sheets did not take into account (as they were designed more for Psions). Yes, I know these are probably very low priority... but such sheets do make it easier to keep track of things. Maybe once the Aeon Novellas have been finished we will see them (speaking of which... I don't see the Aeon Novellas in the project status section of the Monday Meeting Notes... at least not that I recognize at least). Okay... enough rambling for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":2243,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","user":"Shadowstripe","date":". 09-18-2019, 12:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T10:24:02-07:00","id":1336593,"title":"","content":"They WILL have 6 base powers, because they must put at least 1 dot in each of the primary aptitudes.<br /> <br /> About the sheets, I believe they will make the same they did for Core and Aeon, that is make it available when the post-errata version is available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:51:58-07:00","id":1336628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336324#post1336324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of Superiors not really being Stalwarts (which make sense) are Talents actually modern day Daredevils?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Talents are the modern name for what Adventure! called Daredevils&quot; is what I've been saying since the first time the term &quot;Talent&quot; was used publicly.<br /> <br /> Mercer is different, sort of. Like other Talents, he's a paramorph, but he's gone beyond the capabilities of most Talents. He's only a Talent by convention, since there aren't enough people like him for a new category to be established, beyond &quot;Mercer-level Talents.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is what we have how they work both back them and now and such? </div> </div> </div>Given the TC core will be necessary to run Adventure!, and the TC core already has Talent rules, it's a good bet that Adventure! will just use those rules rather than try to reinvent the wheel.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, speaking of Talents, they still have a Psi score, right? </div> </div> </div>As far as anyone who isn't a Project Tantalus researcher is concerned, Talents are and behave like baseline humans. They have the Psi rating that any other neutral has.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:03:20-07:00","id":1336632,"title":"","content":"Awesome stuff. Honestly I am totally fine with not reinventing the wheel when it comes to Talents. Plus it means more room for Stalwart and Mesmerist powers. Hehe","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:07:19-07:00","id":1336634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336632#post1336632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome stuff. Honestly I am totally fine with not reinventing the wheel when it comes to Talents. Plus it means more room for Stalwart and Mesmerist powers. Hehe</div> </div> </div> </div>Might be cool to see some new Gifts, but the system they run on needs no changing or reprinting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:16:48-07:00","id":1336637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336634#post1336634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Might be cool to see some new Gifts, but the system they run on needs no changing or reprinting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I don't disagree with that.But while similar Stalwarts and Mesmerists are basically a different power template and so there are certain changes. Additionally, Stalwart and Mesmerist powers are different, maybe even more direct and potent, then Daredevil/Talent Gifts. A fact which means that they would need a whole different list of available powers. <br /> <br /> At least I would assume so. I mean in 1e Stalwarts and Mesmerists were clearly more powerful then Daredevils.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:32:25-07:00","id":1336641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336637#post1336637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I don't disagree with that.But while similar Stalwarts and Mesmerists are basically a different power template and so there are certain changes. Additionally, Stalwart and Mesmerist powers are different, maybe even more direct and potent, then Daredevil/Talent Gifts. A fact which means that they would need a whole different list of available powers. <br /> <br /> At least I would assume so. I mean in 1e Stalwarts and Mesmerists were clearly more powerful then Daredevils.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well they also had access to the same Dramatic Editing in 1e Adventure!. Talents being exclusive Dramatic Editors (outside from very narrow cases) does a lot to level them with other Tier 2 character types.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:51:18-07:00","id":1336647,"title":"","content":"So I guess Nihjon Superiors who aren\u2019t intelligence Agents need custom Society Paths?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:53:45-07:00","id":1336649,"title":"","content":"Dramatic Editing is a big question mark in my mind when dealing with Stalwarts and Mesmerists. I think, the same way Luck, Psychometry and Telepathy was taken away from Novas, Dramatic Editing should be taken away from the others to keep a better balance between Daredevils and the others.<br /> <br /> As Lord Heru said, Stalwarts and Mesmerists we\u2019re clearly more powerful then Daredevils, and the only chance of balance they used to have was the fact that the total number of Inspiration points was really low and the recovering time was quite long most of time.<br /> <br /> Still, the plot armor and the Cliffhangers were part of ALL Pulp heroes stories, so there must be a balance between what is part of the genre and what is balanced for the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:57:24-07:00","id":1336650,"title":"","content":"I dont really think removing Dramatuc Editing from Stalwarts or Mesmerists are the way to go. Additionally consudering what there greater kin have access to it makes sense Stalwarts and Mesmerists have access to greater power then Talents. This isn't a bad thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:08:40-07:00","id":1336655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336647#post1336647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I guess Nihjon Superiors who aren\u2019t intelligence Agents need custom Society Paths?</div> </div> </div> </div>There are 3 new paths that fit on your idea, one for each of the societies that create Superiors. The Nihonjin Agent (from Aeon) should be more like a CIA or FBI (in modern terms, not the FSA counterparts).<br /> <br /> Honestly, there should be no need for a new Aeon Trinity Society path just for this 15 guys, it\u2019s the same allegiance in the end, unless you bring back Project Utopia as a secret still running project under Aeon Trinity control, that still study Stalwarts and Novas, and so Superiors as an Extension.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:12:52-07:00","id":1336657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336650#post1336650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dont really think removing Dramatuc Editing from Stalwarts or Mesmerists are the way to go. Additionally consudering what there greater kin have access to it makes sense Stalwarts and Mesmerists have access to greater power then Talents. This isn't a bad thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>They CAN have access if the SG let, but it\u2019s not the official position. By Default only Talents get access to DE.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Only Talents Can Use Dramatic Editing: This option ... This method is the default assumption for Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on and for the Trinity Continuum as a whole. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:19:51-07:00","id":1336660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336650#post1336650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dont really think removing Dramatuc Editing from Stalwarts or Mesmerists are the way to go. Additionally consudering what there greater kin have access to it makes sense Stalwarts and Mesmerists have access to greater power then Talents. This isn't a bad thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed. In fact, I could see TC:A! saying that Stalwarts and Mesmerists work exactly like Talents do in every way, save only for their Gifts: rebrand the existing Gifts as Heroic Gifts and introduce new Dynamic Gifts (for Stalwarts) and Psychic Gifts (for Mesmerists), and you're good to go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:23:05-07:00","id":1336661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336657#post1336657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They CAN have access if the SG let, but it\u2019s not the official position. By Default only Talents get access to DE.</div> </div> </div> </div> Technically true. That said, there's at least one Mega-Edge that grants limited access to DE.<br /> <br /> Another possibility to consider is that Daredevils, Stalwarts, and Mesmerists have only begun to diverge in TC:A!. Much like how Superiors are \u201clow level\u201d enough to retain Psi 1 despite having arguably Quantum-based powers, Stalwarts and Mesmerists may still be \u201csimilar enough\u201d to Talents to access DE. Not to the extent that they can pick up the Gifts that Daredevils can develop, mind you; but enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 09-18-2019, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:36:35-07:00","id":1336666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336655#post1336655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are 3 new paths that fit on your idea, one for each of the societies that create Superiors. The Nihonjin Agent (from Aeon) should be more like a CIA or FBI (in modern terms, not the FSA counterparts).<br /> <br /> Honestly, there should be no need for a new Aeon Trinity Society path just for this 15 guys, it\u2019s the same allegiance in the end, unless you bring back Project Utopia as a secret still running project under Aeon Trinity control, that still study Stalwarts and Novas, and so Superiors as an Extension.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are Origin Paths","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:43:29-07:00","id":1336670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336657#post1336657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They CAN have access if the SG let, but it\u2019s not the official position. By Default only Talents get access to DE.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Dramatic Editing is an element of Inspiration and if we go through the idea that 2e Stalwarts and Mesmerists are still Inspired, and thus still have Inspiration, then there is a very good chance they still have Dramatic Editing. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336660#post1336660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed. In fact, I could see TC:A! saying that Stalwarts and Mesmerists work exactly like Talents do in every way, save only for their Gifts: rebrand the existing Gifts as Heroic Gifts and introduce new Dynamic Gifts (for Stalwarts) and Psychic Gifts (for Mesmerists), and you're good to go.</div> </div> </div> </div>This. This is how I think its going to go down. <br /> <br /> It was really cool of them to provide Talents in the Trinity Core, really cool. But Talents are a subset of Inspired and that means in general what is good for them is good for Stalwarts and Mesmerists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:47:40-07:00","id":1336672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336661#post1336661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Technically true. That said, there's at least one Mega-Edge that grants limited access to DE.</div> </div> </div> </div>True and that\u2019s why I referenced narrow exceptions earlier, but that\u2019s also non-diegetic. The Nova (or Superior with Tactics) isn\u2019t reality editing, they just planned ahead really really well as they now reveal and that\u2019s the best way the rules have to simulate it (of course Talents can use Dramatic Editing the same way, but diegetically they also are bending probability in their favor).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:47:54-07:00","id":1336673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336666#post1336666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Those are Origin Paths</div> </div> </div> </div>The lines between Society, Origin and Role are very... thin... I mean, Nihonjin Agent as I see is a Role, Nihon Government is the Society and origin could be the place or experiences they had on early years.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I miss this detail...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T15:00:24-07:00","id":1336677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336672#post1336672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True and that\u2019s why I referenced narrow exceptions earlier, but that\u2019s also non-diegetic. The Nova (or Superior with Tactics) isn\u2019t reality editing, they just planned ahead really really well as they now reveal and that\u2019s the best way the rules have to simulate it (of course Talents can use Dramatic Editing the same way, but diegetically they also are bending probability in their favor).</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, the reason those rules simulate the likes of Tactics so well is that in 1e, they were conceived as a meta-gaming mechanic: diegetically, they didn't represent <i>anything</i> in-game, and were just there to facilitate the pulp genre conventions. Yes, 2e has changed that. But I can guarantee that if TC:A! puts DE off limits for Stalwarts and Mesmerists, it's going to be house-ruled right back in by longtime Adventure! fans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T15:16:35-07:00","id":1336684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336677#post1336677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, the reason those rules simulate the likes of Tactics so well is that in 1e, they were conceived as a meta-gaming mechanic: diegetically, they didn't represent <i>anything</i> in-game, and were just there to facilitate the pulp genre conventions. Yes, 2e has changed that. But I can guarantee that if TC:A! puts DE off limits for Stalwarts and Mesmerists, it's going to be house-ruled right back in by longtime Adventure! fans.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would add a limited to Focus power Dramatic Edition, for example, a Stalwart can spend Inspiration to gain Scale on &quot;Dynamic Effects&quot; while a Mesmerist could spend Inspiration to get access to other Psychic Knacks. Much like a Nova can gain Maxing Out and Psions can have access to the higher dots of their modes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T17:32:42-07:00","id":1336714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336593#post1336593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They WILL have 6 base powers, because they must put at least 1 dot in each of the primary aptitudes.<br /> <br /> About the sheets, I believe they will make the same they did for Core and Aeon, that is make it available when the post-errata version is available.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah... missed that part (damn dyslexia)... all I had seen was the division of the 3 dots between the 6 modes... not that at least one dot had to go into both Aptitudes. That does make Psiads a little more versatile at the start, probably to compensate for their weaker initial stats when compared to Psions, but not in a way that makes them too powerful in this regards. Overall, it makes them comparable... balancing their strengths and weaknesses in different ways to give the players fun alternatives without being just a different flavor of the same thing they already have access to.<br /> <br /> This is what really attracts me to the Aeon setting (besides the whole space drama/opera backdrop). Even when playing two groups that draw power from the same source, the feel of them is very different despite being very similar overall. The only thing that I would change is to allow Psiads to reach Psi 7 like Psions can... true they won't be able to access the transcendent Psi powers that Psions can (maybe if they can reach a Tier 4 or 5 level of power... though that is likely far beyond the scope of the Aeon setting as it currently stands), but I don't like the idea of putting a cap on how developed a PC can get. If Psions can go to Psi 7, then Psiads should be able to reach that level to (even if it is much harder for them to do so). Okay... enough wandering on that tangent... I have a Psiad to flesh out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T19:38:34-07:00","id":1336745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336673#post1336673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The lines between Society, Origin and Role are very... thin... I mean, Nihonjin Agent as I see is a Role, Nihon Government is the Society and origin could be the place or experiences they had on early years.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I miss this detail...</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m inclined to tweak things the same way, but wanted to confirm RAW before I started messing with anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T20:43:29-07:00","id":1336758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowstripe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336714#post1336714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...<br /> <br /> This is what really attracts me to the Aeon setting (besides the whole space drama/opera backdrop). Even when playing two groups that draw power from the same source, the feel of them is very different despite being very similar overall. The only thing that I would change is to allow Psiads to reach Psi 7 like Psions can... true they won't be able to access the transcendent Psi powers that Psions can (maybe if they can reach a Tier 4 or 5 level of power... though that is likely far beyond the scope of the Aeon setting as it currently stands), but I don't like the idea of putting a cap on how developed a PC can get. If Psions can go to Psi 7, then Psiads should be able to reach that level to (even if it is much harder for them to do so). Okay... enough wandering on that tangent... I have a Psiad to flesh out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly I really believe the Psi 6 book limitation is a current limitation, one that the player Psiads would be able to push past if a campaign managed to get to that point. Same with Psi 7 being the Psion max, if a game went to that point then something woudl happen to push the player Psions to higher Psi ratings. <br /> <br /> My one bit of sadness is that Psiads can't achieve Mode 5 in their primary Aptitudes, so on that I would change things a bit. The other option, of course, is to allow an Edge to exist that would let them have an Aptitude go to 5. <br /> <br /> That all said, as it is, its a really nice set of fluff and rules making Psiads feel noetic but also different, and I really like it. It makes me want to play them - which I never really fully felt when it comes to the Psions (probably the alien tinkering which bothers me on a deep level).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T21:22:05-07:00","id":1336767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336758#post1336758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly I really believe the Psi 6 book limitation is a current limitation, one that the player Psiads would be able to push past if a campaign managed to get to that point. Same with Psi 7 being the Psion max, if a game went to that point then something woudl happen to push the player Psions to higher Psi ratings. <br /> <br /> My one bit of sadness is that Psiads can't achieve Mode 5 in their primary Aptitudes, so on that I would change things a bit. The other option, of course, is to allow an Edge to exist that would let them have an Aptitude go to 5. <br /> <br /> That all said, as it is, its a really nice set of fluff and rules making Psiads feel noetic but also different, and I really like it. It makes me want to play them - which I never really fully felt when it comes to the Psions (probably the alien tinkering which bothers me on a deep level).</div> </div> </div> </div>You can go up to 5 in one specific Mode at Psi 6 with the Strong Mode Edge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T01:18:19-07:00","id":1336795,"title":"","content":"Psi 6 is a limitation for psiads because humanity isn\u2019t particularly psionically \u2018refined\u2019 at the moment, with only a couple of centuries of psionic evolution. Psi 7 comes from thousands of years of evolution and practice in a species using their powers. Or, you know, from a race millions of years older and more advanced genetically engineering your species to be able to reach those higher limits.<br /> <br /> Though it may not look it, because you have psions to compare to, being able to naturally reach Psi 6 is pretty impressive on the psionic creatures evolutionary scale. Qin and Chromatics can\u2019t do it - or have the breadth of Aptitudes that humanity has - and they\u2019ve been evolving Psi for thousands of years. <br /> <br /> Getting to Psi 7 (and beyond) is something for humanity to grow into over the rest of its evolution. Or for them to use their ingenuity as they normally do and reverse engineer those biotech pods the aliens gave them and figure out how to make some that enhance all Aptitudes and give higher power boosts. <br /> <br /> These things are story hooks and campaign goals. There\u2019s both in-universe and out-of-universe reasons for different character types to have different limitations and challenges.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T10:29:47-07:00","id":1336896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336795#post1336795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Getting to Psi 7 (and beyond) is something for humanity to grow into over the rest of its evolution. Or for them to use their ingenuity as they normally do and reverse engineer those biotech pods the aliens gave them and figure out how to make some that enhance all Aptitudes and give higher power boosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>While this may change, here's an extremely early look into design intent for the far-future setting, taking place thousands of years after Aeon: psions will have already done exactly this. Psions have the best of both worlds: both the reach of psions and the flexibility of psiads. There may be the occasional old-school psiad throwback who doesn't have the advantage of the upgraded genetics, but for the most part humanity has determined its own genetic potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T10:36:13-07:00","id":1336902,"title":"","content":"The Doyen are described as Psi 7, is it an adaptation to the Psion Limits or is it their real value?<br /> I mean, Psi 8 is Psi Transcendence as Q10 is Quantum Transcendence? The Doyen stoped on Psi7 to avoid e crossing the barrier of the unknown of Psi 8?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T10:53:04-07:00","id":1336906,"title":"","content":"Are Doyen Tier 4 psychomorphs, the way Aeon-era Terats are Tier 4 eximorphs (implying achieving Tier 4 involves shedding anything recognizable as humanity [or equivalent])?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T11:22:05-07:00","id":1336917,"title":"","content":"Doyen being tier 4 wouldn't imply anything about having to shed your humanity to achieve that tier, as They were never human to begin with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T11:55:40-07:00","id":1336920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336917#post1336917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doyen being tier 4 wouldn't imply anything about having to shed your humanity to achieve that tier, as They were never human to begin with.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s why I said \u201cor equivalent\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T12:11:38-07:00","id":1336922,"title":"","content":"My point is that what makes the Doyen the manipulative bastards that they are isn't them being tier 4; it's part of their nature. <br /> <br /> That said, TC:\u00c6 does say that psi evolution ultimately ends with the species becoming beings of pure thought and moving on to another plane of existence. The Doyen explicitly rejected that outcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T12:31:12-07:00","id":1336924,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s why I asked about Psi 8 as an equivalent to Q10, and if they give up on Psi8 to avoid that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T14:38:42-07:00","id":1336943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336922#post1336922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point is that what makes the Doyen the manipulative bastards that they are isn't them being tier 4; it's part of their nature. <br /> <br /> That said, TC:\u00c6 does say that psi evolution ultimately ends with the species becoming beings of pure thought and moving on to another plane of existence. The Doyen explicitly rejected that outcome.</div> </div> </div> </div>And my point was that if the Doyen are examples of Tier 4 Psychomorphs, then based on what we\u2019ve seen of Tier 4 Eximorphs, the implication would be that achieving Tier 4 means shedding anything recognizable as human, and becoming something alien like pure thought and plasma, or an alien god-monster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T14:44:25-07:00","id":1336944,"title":"","content":"I'm agreeing with your conclusion; but I don't think the Doyen are a valid supporting argument for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T16:29:30-07:00","id":1336958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336944#post1336944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm agreeing with your conclusion; but I don't think the Doyen are a valid supporting argument for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Made his words mine.<br /> <br /> Doyen were supposed to ascend but decided to stay behind for fear of the beyond. I don\u2019t think their bodies are a midway point to ascension, it\u2019s more like a forced ascension that didn\u2019t went well, like an Aberrant that transcended because of taint before Quantum...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T00:12:24-07:00","id":1337036,"title":"","content":"They weren\u2019t scared of the beyond, they were scared of everything else that might stand in the way of them reaching the beyond. They tried to rush the evolutionary process, screwed up and doomed themselves to never achieving ascension. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s not official, but to my mind the ascension gateway is Psi 10, same as Quantum 10 for novas makes them something else. For their impatience and hubris, Doyen will forever the capped at Psi 7. That\u2019s as far as psions go (for now) because Doyen don\u2019t know how to do bigger. <br /> <br /> They\u2019re not going to like it if humanity ever reaches Psi 8.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T02:45:02-07:00","id":1337049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1335804#post1335804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing about such plans (from an inworld perspective) is that its hard for scientists to fully take into consideration all the potential methods that an active Psion can use to resist the effects either singularly or in tandem with others in cooperation. Which to me is where the fun is - such plans rarely if ever can truly be kept secret because something will let it out. Which when that happens means Aeon or the Orders will gather personnel and resources to stop the attempt.<br /> <br /> Which is as it should be.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>With the genetics test and Kaga-2, it's pretty much too late.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T12:11:25-07:00","id":1337133,"title":"","content":"I was reading thru the VARG Section in Aexpansion and got a point I would like to clarify/discuss. I am not even sure how to put it in Errata.<br /> <br /> VARGs are 1 Durability, Might and Power Scales above their Size Scale. It got me a second reading to get it, possibly for details I missed in the first reading, but it would be better to clarify it on the list of VARGs advantages.<br /> That\u2019s ok, they are basically super science by definition, but does this rule apply to other vehicles? A Size Scale 2 tank has Durability scale 3? I don\u2019t believe it apply, but need to clarify.<br /> <br /> In the combat VARG description it says the VARG gains 1 scale on defensive stunts against human scales opponents, does it count human scale vargs? My guess is, when talking about humans scale they mean power/Durability scale not size scale, so a size 1 VARG is not human scale, but I may be wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T17:39:05-07:00","id":1337182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337036#post1337036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They weren\u2019t scared of the beyond, they were scared of everything else that might stand in the way of them reaching the beyond. They tried to rush the evolutionary process, screwed up and doomed themselves to never achieving ascension.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s not official, but to my mind the ascension gateway is Psi 10, same as Quantum 10 for novas makes them something else. For their impatience and hubris, Doyen will forever the capped at Psi 7. That\u2019s as far as psions go (for now) because Doyen don\u2019t know how to do bigger.<br /> <br /> They\u2019re not going to like it if humanity ever reaches Psi 8.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> To be honest, I was thinking along the same lines... Psions cap out at Psi 7 because that is the limit of the technology the Doyen have provided them with (though I wasn't entirely sure if that was the limit of Doyen tech since such a paranoid species would very likely hoard the best for themselves to maintain some superior power over those they are trying to dominate). Given this (unofficial) position, it does seem reasonable that Psiads are caped at Psi 6 since humanity has yet to reach the level to unlock Psi 7 naturally (Psions can reach it through the unnatural means provided by the Prometheus Chambers, but that technology is only available to the Psi Orders.<br /> <br /> In time, should the Psi Orders allow access to their Prometheus Chambers, it may become possible for them to be altered in such a way to allow Psiads to attain similar levels... but that would likely require decades of research at the very least (probably even centuries at this point). Ironically... the technology that they Doyen have already provided humanity might be the key that allows humanity to become the very threat they had hoped to prevent.<br /> <br /> Personally though, I think that in my games I will alter the maximum dots that can be put into each mode for Psiads a bit... with them being able to advance to 4/2 (Primary/Secondary) at Psi 4, 4/3 at Psi 5 and 5/3 at Psi 6. By the time my players reach this level and start to take advantage of this, I will be able to judge just how powerful it makes them compared to Psions. Just to be clear, Psiads will not be able to get the 6th or 7th dot in any Primary Aptitude... either through stunting successes to perform at a higher level or through edges like Strong Mode. Psiads just aren't evolved enough to gain these levels of Psi abilities, even at Psi 6. I will also have a few other requirements for them to meet before they can reach such levels of Psi too... so it will likely take at least a year of weekly sessions (at 5 EXP per session) to reach this level of power. Hopefully that will be more than enough time for me to see how this balances out overall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-22T16:24:37-07:00","id":1337395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336655#post1336655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> unless you bring back Project Utopia as a secret still running project under Aeon Trinity control, that still study Stalwarts and Novas, and so Superiors as an Extension.</div> </div> </div> </div>Note that this exists and is called Project Cetus. Utopia is still around too, but more concerned with general futurism.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23899-topher-gerkey","name":"Topher Gerkey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-22T18:00:46-07:00","id":1337405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Topher Gerkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337395#post1337395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Note that this exists and is called Project Cetus. Utopia is still around too, but more concerned with general futurism.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the survival of Project Utopia it makes a lot of sense that in the aftermath of the Aberrant War the leaders of Aeon quietly absorbed Utopia back into itself. While let the infrastructure fade when it could come back home. <br /> <br /> On Project Cetus, hmm, that's interesting. I never head of that branch division. But its cool though. Honestly, imagine if at some point leaders in Aeon come together and say &quot;Instead of Psiads and Novas why don't we try and make as many people as possible into Inspired&quot; and then comes up with a plan using the centuries of knowledge they have on the power groups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T02:33:22-07:00","id":1337456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337405#post1337405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> On the survival of Project Utopia it makes a lot of sense that in the aftermath of the Aberrant War the leaders of Aeon quietly absorbed Utopia back into itself. While let the infrastructure fade when it could come back home.<br /> <br /> On Project Cetus, hmm, that's interesting. I never head of that branch division. But its cool though. Honestly, imagine if at some point leaders in Aeon come together and say &quot;Instead of Psiads and Novas why don't we try and make as many people as possible into Inspired&quot; and then comes up with a plan using the centuries of knowledge they have on the power groups.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's Project Ceto actually. &quot;Formerly the research branch ofthe 21st century Project Utopia, Ceto exists to study Aberrants and their superhuman abilities.&quot; It also says they want to study Superiors, but are blocked by political barriers. Oddly enough, Aeon Aexpansion says the team creating the Aeon superiors was put together by Operation Utopia.<br /> <br /> As for parts of Project Utopia surviving, let alone the name, I can't see it. After the Aberrant Wars, they should have been pariahs, like fascists were after WWII. Even Aeon should be, unless Project Rewrite actually rewrites history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T11:39:05-07:00","id":1337516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337456#post1337456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's Project Ceto actually.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I get for not doublechecking before I talk about something I wrote years ago!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for parts of Project Utopia surviving, let alone the name, I can't see it. After the Aberrant Wars, they should have been pariahs, like fascists were after WWII. Even Aeon should be, unless Project Rewrite actually rewrites history. </div> </div> </div>Fascism as an ideology is bad/harmful. Utopia's (or Aeon's) ideology is just &quot;let us help you use your talents to make the world better.&quot; Utopia can't be held responsible for quantum flux - it's literally not something in their control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23899-topher-gerkey","name":"Topher Gerkey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T13:56:10-07:00","id":1337534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Topher Gerkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337516#post1337516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's what I get for not doublechecking before I talk about something I wrote years ago!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Fascism as an ideology is bad/harmful. Utopia's (or Aeon's) ideology is just &amp;quot;let us help you use your talents to make the world better.&amp;quot; Utopia can't be held responsible for quantum flux - it's literally not something in their control.</div> </div> </div> </div>The fascism comparison was clumsy for the reason you say, but I agree with muon\u2019s point that to the general public, former Nova-support institutions would be seen as collaborators who brought this down on the world.<br /> <br /> Project Proteus going public to take out novas with Medusa Protocols though is probably why it was accepted enough to survive as part of the Aeon Trinity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T19:49:14-07:00","id":1337578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Topher Gerkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337516#post1337516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's what I get for not doublechecking before I talk about something I wrote years ago!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Fascism as an ideology is bad/harmful. Utopia's (or Aeon's) ideology is just &quot;let us help you use your talents to make the world better.&quot; Utopia can't be held responsible for quantum flux - it's literally not something in their control.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're more like a technocracy, but how is fascism as an ideology worse than communism? Before WWII, there were a lot of people like H.G. Wells who thought it was a reasonable compromise between communism and the failing liberal democracy. I should probably spin this off into it's own thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2893,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","user":"muon","date":". 09-23-2019, 11:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T20:36:31-07:00","id":1337582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1337578#post1337578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They're more like a technocracy, but how is fascism as an ideology worse than communism? Before WWII, there were a lot of people like H.G. Wells who thought it was a reasonable compromise between communism and the failing liberal democracy. I should probably spin this off into it's own thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because Communist theory doesn\u2019t ideologically rely on radical nativism, the demonization of perceived foreign \u201cOther\u201d, Social Darwinist supremacism within the state, and a cult of action which rejects thought as weakness. Marxist <i>regimes</i> often do, but if we\u2019re talking about viewpoints on the theory, that\u2019s a difference. Fascism is inseparable from ethno-nationalism.<br /> <br /> Now Marxist Regimes have been murderous totalitarian hellscapes to be sure (and i\u2019d point out in actual Marxist theory, the whole concept of a \u201cMarxist state\u201d is an oxymoron), but Marxism also heavily influenced labor movements in democratic countries which improved civil rights and standards of living around the world. By comparison fascist theory (to the degree a philosophy of action that rejects thought can be said to have a \u201ctheory\u201d) has contributed nothing remotely positive to society.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 09-24-2019, 05:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T07:17:31-07:00","id":1337631,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t think Aeon image was burned with the Aberrant War. As Glamourweaver said Aeon acted against the Aberrants during the war and after, with Proteus and probably the help of some novas. Also, Aeon made a fortune during the Nova age and spend much of this resources on the reconstruction and giving support to the population, it\u2019s said that they build schools and houses for people after the war, so they recovered any burned image really fast after that. Also, that\u2019s why they got so much power in Aeon Age (to the point to the entire period be called by its name).<br /> <br /> Aberrant war don\u2019t look like a total war against an clear enemy, at least not until close to the end. Many novas were helping humanity against the Aberrants, and there were humans on the Aberrant side. For sure the world was a dangerous place, but people didn\u2019t stop thrusting Novas until close to the end, as we see many Aberrant era colonies being funded not by aberrant cultists but by general population leaving the world with Nova help.<br /> <br /> Of course by the end, probably the last few years, many novas end up becoming Aberrants, even the ones that helped before, just because they had accumulated too much Flux during fights and probably direct exposition to quantum flux. Also there was all the news about the raging war, the places destroyed and all, that changed the population opinion quite fast by the end, when Utopia already had give up on helping Novas and T2M were gone for good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T14:14:11-07:00","id":1337700,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure it would have been very easy for Aeon to absorb Utopia with no long term issues. <br /> <br /> Anyway, on Aexpansion what sort of Powers do you think might be in theme for Superiors. I'm not asking for mechanical writeups, just ideas that might have came to you upon reading the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T14:45:01-07:00","id":1337706,"title":"","content":"I was thinking on the Inspired Super Science items created by Superiors early today. Does the Superior Powers count as Edges dot by dot?<br /> <br /> On the question, I think they are missing some heightened senses powers, maybe an Tireless and powers related to drugs/alcohol resistance. That\u2019s what I missed so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-26T21:03:15-07:00","id":1338102,"title":"","content":"Soooo I wonder how much Experience it would take to bring a Psiad to a point where they have something like 3 or 4 dots in every Mode, hehe. Obviously such a person would be pretty epic in their capability, which is somewhat fun to think about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T00:52:05-07:00","id":1338117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1338102#post1338102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soooo I wonder how much Experience it would take to bring a Psiad to a point where they have something like 3 or 4 dots in every Mode, hehe. Obviously such a person would be pretty epic in their capability, which is somewhat fun to think about.</div> </div> </div> </div>To get to Psi 5, with 3 dots in every Mode, would require 243 xp.<br /> To get to Psi 6, with 4 dots in your primaries and 3 in everything else, would cost 297 total xp.<br /> If you've got the Strong Mode Edge, you could also boost one Mode to 5 dots for another 8 xp, for a grand total of 305 xp.<br /> <br /> ...I may also have been thinking about this <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T08:00:10-07:00","id":1338138,"title":"","content":"For the noetic super science rules, under the enhancement noetic devices, it lists &quot;+oooo Provide the benefits of working with a single other type of psion with a specific different Aptitude to a single Mode&quot;.<br /> <br /> Some of those, however, require the assisting psion's Psi rating. For example, the Vitakinesis enhancement effect is &quot;Add the vitakinetic's PSI trait as an Enhancement to powers on living creatures&quot;.<br /> <br /> Since the biotech device doesn't have a Psi rating, how would you rule this? Assume the Psi rating is equal to the device rating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2947-forgeeternal","name":"ForgeEternal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T10:02:53-07:00","id":1338154,"title":"","content":"Presumably it would be formatted, right? So I'd use the user's Psi rating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T00:59:24-07:00","id":1338243,"title":"","content":"Cyberware purchased with the \u201cCybernetics Access\u201d Edge still require any additional Edge points be invested, right? \u201cCybernetics Access\u201d just replaces the Wealth cost?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T04:24:08-07:00","id":1338249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1338243#post1338243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cyberware purchased with the \u201cCybernetics Access\u201d Edge still require any additional Edge points be invested, right? \u201cCybernetics Access\u201d just replaces the Wealth cost?</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I understand, only Wealth is covered, and Edge related cybernetics still requires the Edges.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T03:35:46-07:00","id":1338429,"title":"","content":"Since Psiads won't usually belong to the Psi Orders, what other Society Paths from the various books would make good fits for them? Are the Paths from the Core book (Lightkeepers, Archangels, etc.) assumed to be active in 2123? If not, that basically just leaves the Aeon Trinity (especially Project Pandora), Section Minerva, and Freelance Psion Paths; I could also see a strong case being made for the Chitra Bhanu, since they're a bunch of secretive, scientifically curious folks who hate the Doyen and would probably appreciate psionic help that doesn't rely on Doyen-granted Prometheus Chambers, especially given their shared QK ability. I know this is obviously going to be highly campaign-dependent, but does anybody have any thoughts on this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T03:44:25-07:00","id":1338430,"title":"","content":"Paths are very easy and quick to make. TC Core tells you exactly how to make them. Simply make something that fits your psiad\u2019s concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T05:12:40-07:00","id":1338439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wynterknight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1338429#post1338429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since Psiads won't usually belong to the Psi Orders, what other Society Paths from the various books would make good fits for them? Are the Paths from the Core book (Lightkeepers, Archangels, etc.) assumed to be active in 2123? If not, that basically just leaves the Aeon Trinity (especially Project Pandora), Section Minerva, and Freelance Psion Paths; I could also see a strong case being made for the Chitra Bhanu, since they're a bunch of secretive, scientifically curious folks who hate the Doyen and would probably appreciate psionic help that doesn't rely on Doyen-granted Prometheus Chambers, especially given their shared QK ability. I know this is obviously going to be highly campaign-dependent, but does anybody have any thoughts on this?</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be neat to have an update on the different organizations as well as some unique to the era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T10:48:00-07:00","id":1338479,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d imagine S.K. is sympathetic to Psiads, and even with the Chits\u2019 research orientation, they know enough about Psiads and desire to protect potential QKs enough to serve as underground recruiters and protectors for Psiads. So i\u2019d count them as an exception to the general rule of Psiads avoiding the Orders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 09-29-2019, 11:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T15:46:11-07:00","id":1338881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wynterknight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1338117#post1338117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To get to Psi 5, with 3 dots in every Mode, would require 243 xp.<br /> To get to Psi 6, with 4 dots in your primaries and 3 in everything else, would cost 297 total xp.<br /> If you've got the Strong Mode Edge, you could also boost one Mode to 5 dots for another 8 xp, for a grand total of 305 xp.<br /> <br /> ...I may also have been thinking about this <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I realized my math was dramatically off and it's been bothering me so I had to address it lol. <br /> To get to Psi 5, with 3 dots in every Mode, would require 687 xp (45 Psi, 192 Primary Modes, 450 Secondary). <br /> To get to Psi 6, with 4 dots in your primaries and 3 in everything else, would cost an additional 252 xp (+30 Psi, +72 Primary, +150 Secondary), for a total of 939 xp. <br /> If you've got the Strong Mode Edge, you could also boost one Mode to 5 dots for another 8 xp, for a grand total of 947 xp.<br /> <br /> So uhhhh only like 3x more than I originally said (because I'm pretty sure I was only doing the math for 1 mode per aptitude the first time lol). It should only take you like, what, a couple of dozen games to get that much xp? \ud83d\ude0b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T19:27:59-07:00","id":1338912,"title":"","content":"My counting is<br /> Psi 2-5 = 45XP<br /> Modes<br /> Primary 3-28 (8x3+1x4)= 200XP<br /> Secondary 0-45 (5x3x3)= 450XP<br /> Edge = 9XP<br /> Total = 704XP<br /> <br /> From max5 to max6<br /> Psi 5-6 = 30XP<br /> Modes<br /> Primary 28-37 = 72XP<br /> Secondary (don\u2019t increase) =0XP<br /> Total= 102XP<br /> <br /> Total total = 806","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 10-02-2019, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T02:16:05-07:00","id":1338968,"title":"","content":"Yup, you're correct! I mistakenly increased all of the secondaries to 4 dots in my calculations, and didn't actually add the cost of the Strong Mode edge. Either way, kind of a lot lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4009-wynterknight","name":"Wynterknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T09:12:25-07:00","id":1339006,"title":"","content":"My favorite part of the Psiad rules is that they don't invalidate the Psion rules. With that much XP you could be one hell of a proxy level Psion! I personally don't mind the Prometheus tech coming from aliens, think of it as a gift, but the secret back door for their telepathy is the kicker.<br /> <br /> Especially with the feats humanity has been able to achieve with biotech that push the boundaries of what other races can do (Leviathans), overcoming these hurdles (in game) would be a noble and achievable goal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T11:08:54-07:00","id":1339022,"title":"","content":"Changing subjects a little as I was talking to some of my old Adventure! Players...<br /> <br /> I definitely can imagine the way Stalwarts would work with Superior-esque rules. Add a Inspiration rating to allow them to overclock themselves (in the best Maxing Out rules, effect that was blocked from superiors to give no chance of gaining taint). Maybe limit the number of dots a Stalwart have in their powers to \u00bd Inspiration or to a facet (less probable)<br /> <br /> For Mesmerists I would keep the same idea as Psiads, but exchange Psi for Inspiration and limit all the modes. Probably make the base powers buyable by themselves and make the 1 and 2 dots available for theirs that have enough inspiration. Limit the Attunement Range and other effects to a lower level comparing to Psiad, possibly 1 Psi equal to 3 Inspiration. That means I would make a Superior Power stile for mesmerists, using the lower dots of the modes as reference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 10-02-2019, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T11:23:30-07:00","id":1339025,"title":"","content":"That would be worth discussing in its own thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T12:36:51-07:00","id":1339039,"title":"","content":"Just to check, has anyone been using the feedback form? I've been kinda busy with real life, and just want to make sure it is getting a good errata pass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T12:53:07-07:00","id":1339045,"title":"","content":"I made a few observations, but no typos is anything like it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-02T13:20:11-07:00","id":1339053,"title":"","content":"I noted that the Superior Origin paths have Cyberware listed without saying if they\u2019re free, required to buy (some of them have Edge cost) or what.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-03T04:23:28-07:00","id":1339155,"title":"","content":"I reported that the creation steps for Superiors repeated Attributes twice for steps three and four, along with some observations about the Kaga-2 virus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T03:25:04-07:00","id":1339790,"title":"","content":"When the truth about the Doyen and the Proxies is revealed, what will Sandoval Gutierrez and Monolith do, considering he was right about them? Would he accept psiads if the difference between them and psions was shown to him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T23:41:33-07:00","id":1340165,"title":"","content":"Got some time and focus to sit down and read a bit, stumbled upon this gem-<br /> &quot;a vitakinetic can combine her<br /> three-dot Algesis power, Ruin, with the three-dot<br /> Iatrosis power, Mending, to access and degrade her<br /> own noetic template, then rebuild it around the cyberware<br /> she wants to use.&quot;<br /> <br /> That is immensely cool, and something I hadn't thought of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T23:52:56-07:00","id":1340166,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m not saying that the Nakamura Procedure should be beyond baseline (or Talent) invention - that\u2019s a writer call that CAN make sense either way - but I\u2019m surprised the history of said Procedure doesn\u2019t incorporate Nova invention more directly as a point to make Nippon\u2019s now lost secret Novas have more lasting relevance. I feel like currently you could cut them without losing anything from the setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 10-08-2019, 04:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T00:29:37-07:00","id":1340171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1340166#post1340166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m not saying that the Nakamura Procedure should be beyond baseline (or Talent) invention - that\u2019s a writer call that CAN make sense either way - but I\u2019m surprised the history of said Procedure does to incorporate Nova invention more directly as a point to make Nippon\u2019s now lost secret Novas have more lasting relevance. I feel like currently you could cut them without losing anything from the setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, they constructed the SIs that run the arcology, and *something* might be coming from that in an upcoming book...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T13:26:28-07:00","id":1340671,"title":"","content":"Someone that is a bit more familiar with the base drone rules, could you take a look at the Long Ranged tag and compare it to the flavor text of how the long ranged drones are used? I think I might be missing something.<br /> <br /> The Long Ranged tag makes it sound like you need to be within 10km to use it, but then the flavor text is talking about users basically using these drones as robo-tourism and using them from the other side of the planet. Wasn't sure if there was a disconnect there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T17:24:40-07:00","id":1340702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1340671#post1340671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone that is a bit more familiar with the base drone rules, could you take a look at the Long Ranged tag and compare it to the flavor text of how the long ranged drones are used? I think I might be missing something.<br /> <br /> The Long Ranged tag makes it sound like you need to be within 10km to use it, but then the flavor text is talking about users basically using these drones as robo-tourism and using them from the other side of the planet. Wasn't sure if there was a disconnect there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you miss the part in the text box on p.25?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Biotech drones controlled via a VR suit are controlled through the OpNet, and so suffer none of the range limitations of formatted biotech drones. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T20:46:06-07:00","id":1340714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1340702#post1340702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Did you miss the part in the text box on p.25?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I sure didn't! Thanks! Although, still doesn't quite jive with people sending blood samples through the post in order to format to the suit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T21:16:44-07:00","id":1340720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1340714#post1340714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I sure didn't! Thanks! Although, still doesn't quite jive with people sending blood samples through the post in order to format to the suit.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> These drones can be formatted simply by the user mailing a fresh but quite small blood sample to shop offer-ing the drone for rent, but most users operate them using a VR suit. </div> </div> </div>Most users aren\u2019t sending blood. The ones who do are those wanting to use the drone at closer range (probably not for far-flung tourism), or people who can operate the drone at range. Many clears can pilot these drones through Attunement anywhere on Earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T11:28:28-07:00","id":1340809,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1340720#post1340720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Most users aren\u2019t sending blood. The ones who do are those wanting to use the drone at closer range (probably not for far-flung tourism), or people who can operate the drone at range. Many clears can pilot these drones through Attunement anywhere on Earth.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for walking me through it..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-12T08:12:08-07:00","id":1340953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1339790#post1339790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When the truth about the Doyen and the Proxies is revealed, what will Sandoval Gutierrez and Monolith do, considering he was right about them? Would he accept psiads if the difference between them and psions was shown to him?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, on the former, I think it'd depend on the context. In general, it likely means he cleaves even harder to his paranoia and determination to bring down psionic influence, dialling up Monolith's worst traits to 11 - but if the truth came out publicly and in a way that hugely damaged the Psi Orders' influence, I could see him assessing whether or not to go public himself in an attempt to rally people against the enemy. Whether that'd work out well is anyone's guess.<br /> <br /> On the latter, Sandoval believes that the way forward for humanity is via neither psi nor nova, so psiads go against his vision of a future new order. They may not reflect the direct work of the conspiracy he believes exists, but even if convinced they're a natural manifestation of psi power, he can't really control them either. As such, I imagine he'd view them as a nuisance, a rogue element to be gotten rid of - or, actually, thinking about it, if he discovers psiads before getting proof of the Doyen etc, he'd likely want to get psiads into Monolith labs where they can be experimented upon to figure out <i>how</i> the 'conspiracy' managed to create psions in the first place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-16T12:26:01-07:00","id":1341678,"title":"","content":"As a matter of information, \u00c6xpansion is updated in DTRPG. All the Page XX are corrected and the (* to *) things too.<br /> <br /> I dont know if I read it with another mind but some texts are a bit clearer (I didn\u2019t put the old and the new side by side).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T20:09:12-07:00","id":1342263,"title":"","content":"Anyone else notice that the Psiad Template doesn't actually say what your starting Psi is?<br /> <br /> I mean, the answer is almost certainly 2. But at no point does it say that you record a Psi trait of 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T20:21:25-07:00","id":1342266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342263#post1342263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone else notice that the Psiad Template doesn't actually say what your starting Psi is?<br /> <br /> I mean, the answer is almost certainly 2. But at no point does it say that you record a Psi trait of 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I hope they consider adding that to the book as I think having it spelled out would be helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T20:48:19-07:00","id":1342268,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s 2, same as most psions. You\u2019re right that we haven\u2019t included it but I think it\u2019s reasonably self-evident. I mean, Psi 1 has a Mode maximum of 0 and your psiad characters start with dots in Modes, so it\u2019s not that, and we spend a fair number of words describing how you get QK as a bonus primary Aptitude, and can\u2019t take teleportation, until you reach Psi 3 - all of which would be strange and redundant if psiads started higher than Psi 2. <br /> <br /> And unfortunately, no one called it out on the errata feedback form so it didn\u2019t get addressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T21:03:38-07:00","id":1342270,"title":"","content":"Did anyone clarify whether the cybernetics listed with the Superior Origin Paths are supposed to be free (including whether you need to spend the Edge fits where relevant)? I can\u2019t find it if so, and I know it was mentioned in the errata doc because I mentioned it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-19T05:47:53-07:00","id":1342336,"title":"","content":"I believe they\u2019re meant to be free. The Nippon Government character gets some cool stuff, but balances this with a Kill Switch that the government could activate if they go rogue. Or, you know, that some kind of unfriendly psion could activate...<br /> <br /> Akiyama superiors get less free cyber, but are also less prone to instant death. And AEon get none of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-19T11:23:34-07:00","id":1342380,"title":"","content":"So re-reading (xsome number) Aeon Aexpansion has me realizing something. One of the main reasons I like Talents, Superiors, Psiads (and Psions) is that there is nothing negative in their powers. Their isn't a morality stat or a forced weakness or a great curse, or anything like that with the reason of just because. They are what they are. Their powers aren't a corrupting influence. <br /> <br /> I guess, going one thought further, one of the things that make me sad about Novas is that they do have such a forced weakness, a corrupting power. The one group in the whole setting that does. Which yes, I realize some will say is part of the theme, but to me that lessons the fun of them. Which is also I guess why for all that I love certain aspects of Aberrant I have been turning my attention more to the other groups, Superiors and Psiads most especially but also Talents, which are marvelous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-19T22:39:38-07:00","id":1342473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342380#post1342380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess, going one thought further, one of the things that make me sad about Novas is that they do have such a forced weakness, a corrupting power. The one group in the whole setting that does.</div> </div> </div> </div>While Taint was certainly corruptive, and the human-centric \u00c6on Trinity has framed it as capital-C &quot;Corruption&quot;, it should be noted that this isn't necessarily the case in Aberrant.<br /> <br /> Transcendence is transformative. Novas are becoming something else, something divorced from their human ancestry. That's not necessarily wrong or bad, it's just different. I know that it may be tough to wrap your head around, especially from a 1e context, but it's there nonetheless.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T00:14:13-07:00","id":1342483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342473#post1342473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While Taint was certainly corruptive, and the human-centric \u00c6on Trinity has framed it as capital-C &amp;quot;Corruption&amp;quot;, it should be noted that this isn't necessarily the case in Aberrant.<br /> <br /> Transcendence is transformative. Novas are becoming something else, something divorced from their human ancestry. That's not necessarily wrong or bad, it's just different. I know that it may be tough to wrap your head around, especially from a 1e context, but it's there nonetheless.</div> </div> </div> </div>I get that diegeticly, but when the rules say \u201chand over your character sheet\u201d it\u2019s hard not to take that as a lose condition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T09:05:36-07:00","id":1342537,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342473#post1342473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While Taint was certainly corruptive, and the human-centric \u00c6on Trinity has framed it as capital-C &quot;Corruption&quot;, it should be noted that this isn't necessarily the case in Aberrant.<br /> <br /> Transcendence is transformative. Novas are becoming something else, something divorced from their human ancestry. That's not necessarily wrong or bad, it's just different. I know that it may be tough to wrap your head around, especially from a 1e context, but it's there nonetheless.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well yeah theoretically. But when Transcendence takes a character away from the player how else but 'bad' can one to take it. Additionally, I don't see anything positive about having it. If there was some mechanism that actually game an interesting mechanical boost, that could showcase it is not all bad. <br /> <br /> Like I said I get how its technically a theme, I just wish it wasn't. <br /> <br /> Which is why I am turning my mind towards the positives of the rest of the TC universe rather than dwell on the one thing that I find frustrating. And there are a lot of positives. A lot of good things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T22:04:05-07:00","id":1342650,"title":"","content":"Keep in mind that unless you intentionally push it, the 'natural' development of a Nova allows them to achieve the height of power with a minimal amount of transformations, and certainly nothing that unmanageable. You will be <i>marked</i>, but for the sort of people who are playing superhumans, &quot;I have glowy eyes, my skin is purple, and I got really, really ripped to Hulk-like levels&quot;, is not really a <i>disadvantage</i>, is it? (After all, if you perfectly manage your flux, your Transcendence maxes out at 6. That's two minor transformations and one moderate one.)<br /> <br /> Heck, I'd be interested in underlining the point by seeing a chapter or section with new transformations in a future book (assuming Aberrant ever gets an 'Aexpansion' of its own) to underscore the 'not necessarily <i>bad</i>' thing. High-level ones should almost always be a bit of a stumble, but even then I've had characters where I'm genuinely okay with Power Lock on a given power or Hardened Epidermis so the Colossus expy is walking around with steely skin properly. (One reason I liked the idea of some sort of edge that allows you to voluntarily take on a transformation ahead of schedule, with the benefit being you get to skip out on taking an actual transformation, come that time.)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T01:17:30-07:00","id":1342663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342473#post1342473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While Taint was certainly corruptive, and the human-centric \u00c6on Trinity has framed it as capital-C &quot;Corruption&quot;, it should be noted that this isn't necessarily the case in Aberrant.<br /> <br /> Transcendence is transformative. Novas are becoming something else, something divorced from their human ancestry. That's not necessarily wrong or bad, it's just different. I know that it may be tough to wrap your head around, especially from a 1e context, but it's there nonetheless.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Transformations described, like lack of control of power or severe psychological disorders, seem bad, as does Quantum Instability. In the Full Transformation, &quot;Novas undergoing full transformation can twist and mutate in terrible ways, with no known limits. What is more, aberrants are no longer capable of any sort of human empathy or compassion. They are utterly transformed into monsters, and even the least vicious of them are cruelly indifferent to humanity.&quot; You might be able to justify indifference by transformation into something inhuman, but viciousness? It sounds like the Sabbat, where they're actually obsessed with their human beginnings. A Nova doesn't even need Full Transformation to reach maximum Quantum and undergo Quantum Transcendence (really need new terminology here).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T02:39:23-07:00","id":1342672,"title":"","content":"I have to defend Ian here. Transcendence is not necessarily evil, but it can be.<br /> <br /> Imagin you are a ant that become human, after sometime you stop caring about ants, the same way we do, it\u2019s not evil per se, it\u2019s just... inant (inhuman for ants), you don\u2019t care you just have better things to think about other than not stepping on ants.<br /> <br /> The same way you don\u2019t gain any extra XP for, let\u2019s say, needing a wheel chair or being blind, you can create a Nova with an specific situation that is a transformation before the proper level of Transcendence, and you gain Momentum when the condition come to play. That\u2019s the idea for putting disabilities in the game and not treating than as weaknesses as other games treats.<br /> <br /> Being purple, or being made of metal, or blind, or unable to walk without an equipment, or being gay or black is not a weakness, it\u2019s not bad and not even a problem if you live in a controled environment (where there is no prejudice or you have all the needs attempted). If you are on a environment that treat you bad for being like this, than you must adapt, in game terms gain Momentum, if not, you are a person as any other. That\u2019s very interesting way to deal with it.<br /> <br /> transcendence is another thing, it\u2019s about being inhuman, the same way we are inant, or incow, Novas are superior to humans and they feel superior to humans as we feel superior to ants, that makes them think in a different way, not much different from what you see wen dealing with people of power (super rich, politicians, and in some cases even public servers and police), they start caring less about the regular people and be more concerned about their own problems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T14:35:24-07:00","id":1342807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342672#post1342672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to defend Ian here. Transcendence is not necessarily evil, but it can be.<br /> <br /> Imagin you are a ant that become human, after sometime you stop caring about ants, the same way we do, it\u2019s not evil per se, it\u2019s just... inant (inhuman for ants), you don\u2019t care you just have better things to think about other than not stepping on ants.<br /> <br /> The same way you don\u2019t gain any extra XP for, let\u2019s say, needing a wheel chair or being blind, you can create a Nova with an specific situation that is a transformation before the proper level of Transcendence, and you gain Momentum when the condition come to play. That\u2019s the idea for putting disabilities in the game and not treating than as weaknesses as other games treats.<br /> <br /> Being purple, or being made of metal, or blind, or unable to walk without an equipment, or being gay or black is not a weakness, it\u2019s not bad and not even a problem if you live in a controled environment (where there is no prejudice or you have all the needs attempted). If you are on a environment that treat you bad for being like this, than you must adapt, in game terms gain Momentum, if not, you are a person as any other. That\u2019s very interesting way to deal with it.<br /> <br /> transcendence is another thing, it\u2019s about being inhuman, the same way we are inant, or incow, Novas are superior to humans and they feel superior to humans as we feel superior to ants, that makes them think in a different way, not much different from what you see wen dealing with people of power (super rich, politicians, and in some cases even public servers and police), they start caring less about the regular people and be more concerned about their own problems.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right, but extra-diagetically the fact that it strips you of your character if it hits a certain point makes it unavoidably a punishment mechanic. I\u2019m not saying that it shouldn\u2019t be in the game - I\u2019d tweak it a bit, but there being a mechanic enforcing the themes the cost of power alienating a Nova from humanity is a good thing! But I disagree with the argument it isn\u2019t a cost and is a neutral mechanic rather than a negative one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T14:42:37-07:00","id":1342808,"title":"","content":"In some ways it reminds me of the whole Dark Side mechanic in the old West End Games D6 Star Wars. In that if you got a certain number of Dark Side Points your character was taken from you and became a GM NPC. <br /> <br /> I'm not really a fan of such a thing. <br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> That all said, I honestly didn't mean to make something that was a harp. I was trying to say that TC is one of those game lines that I basically love pretty much everything about most of its rules and templates and groups and setting. That it has such potential for so many possible games, and that is brilliant to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T15:16:15-07:00","id":1342812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342807#post1342807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I disagree with the argument it isn\u2019t a cost and is a neutral mechanic rather than a negative one.</div> </div> </div> </div> I agree, it\u2019s a punishment mechanic to make it possible to overuse quantum but still be unquestionably bad for the player. Not just the part when you lose your character, but all the way until that, be horrible in dealing with people is horrible, multiple personalities is horrible, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T15:34:26-07:00","id":1342815,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s not a generic supers game. Aberrant has setting assumptions and these include that Quantum power inevitably transcends the human into something inhuman. That\u2019s what it is. <br /> <br /> If you want to play generic supers, you can simply drop the corruption/transcendence assumptions and mechanics. Job done. But it\u2019s not Aberrant, and doesn\u2019t hit the same themes. And that\u2019s okay at your table.<br /> <br /> Perhaps one day humanity\u2019s unique ability to be able to evolve along psi and quantum paths - combined with the also unique new Aptitude of Quantakinesis - will mean humans can evolve into a species that can comfortably accommodate both power sources within the one being, possibly without losing their humanity. But that day isn\u2019t now. Right now we\u2019re at the beginning of an evolutionary process that we don\u2019t know the end of. And we have many, many significant obstacles to our evolutionary path on the way, including loss of humanity, vicious war between the two sides, and external alien influences working to domesticate our capability into something they can use as their tool.<br /> <br /> Edit to add: And this is an interesting topic of discussion, but it has very little to do with the AEon AExpansion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T15:55:29-07:00","id":1342820,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I\u2019m not arguing for generic supers, I\u2019m pro-Flux and Transcendence in the system (though I plan to tweak the mechanics for lowering Flux to focus on Ties with Baselines)! I\u2019m just saying it is a negative mechanic. Not \u201cnegative\u201d in the sense of \u201churts the game\u201d, I\u2019m just saying it is a penalty in actual play consequences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T03:51:52-07:00","id":1342911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342672#post1342672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to defend Ian here. Transcendence is not necessarily evil, but it can be.<br /> <br /> Imagin you are a ant that become human, after sometime you stop caring about ants, the same way we do, it\u2019s not evil per se, it\u2019s just... inant (inhuman for ants), you don\u2019t care you just have better things to think about other than not stepping on ants.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>What about the viciousness?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T04:09:12-07:00","id":1342913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342911#post1342911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What about the viciousness?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not all transcendent Novas become vicious... Trancendence is not necessarily evil, but can be.<br /> Keeping the idea of the ants, some people like to burn ants, others don\u2019t care... that\u2019s the idea. I tried to use examples of not caring as we have lots of examples of rampaging and vicious novas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T13:03:06-07:00","id":1343001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1342815#post1342815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit to add: And this is an interesting topic of discussion, but it has very little to do with the AEon AExpansion.</div> </div> </div> </div> Agreed. With this in mind, I've extracted this last page of posts to a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1342999-transcendence-threat-or-menace\">new thread</a> so it can be discussed on its own terms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-27T15:38:39-07:00","id":1344080,"title":"","content":"I just had a Superior Power idea. A combined Mental and Social power that basically allows a Superior to influence and control an organization (of varying types so both a business a political organization and a military unit count) that he is in charge of in an easier, enhanced way. I think it would be fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T12:28:39-07:00","id":1344715,"title":"","content":"Sooo this isn't me asking when but rather if the Aeon Expansion will become something we can physically purchase at some point. (I would like to ask if there is any potential of us who bought it in Kickstarter maybe getting a slight discount, but that is secondary). <br /> <br /> I ask because after my physical copy of the Core and Aeon arrived I want Aeon Aexpansion to have a physical form as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T13:46:01-07:00","id":1344742,"title":"","content":"From the Monday meeting notes, it looks like it will be available in PoD. Not sure about any discount.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T17:03:53-07:00","id":1344775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1344715#post1344715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sooo this isn't me asking when but rather if the Aeon Expansion will become something we can physically purchase at some point.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you help me? I'm wondering something.<br /> <br /> This is one of those questions I see a lot. From people who've been following us for years.<br /> <br /> I can't think of a single case in almost eight years where we A) released a PDF, and B) it's big enough (~50 pages) to turn into print-on-demand, where we <i>haven't</i> turned on that option.<br /> <br /> DriveThruRPG is our primary marketplace, so we're going to PoD everything we reasonably can.<br /> <br /> So why do people keep asking this question like it's an uncertain thing? Have we ever led anyone to think the outcome is in question?<br /> <br /> I'm seriously curious. I don't understand why this question keeps being asked practically every time, from people who've been with us long enough that I would think they'd know the answer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T17:08:45-07:00","id":1344777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1344775#post1344775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can you help me? I'm wondering something.<br /> <br /> This is one of those questions I see a lot. From people who've been following us for years.<br /> <br /> I can't think of a single case in almost eight years where we A) released a PDF, and B) it's big enough (~50 pages) to turn into print-on-demand, where we <i>haven't</i> turned on that option.<br /> <br /> DriveThruRPG is our primary marketplace, so we're going to PoD everything we reasonably can.<br /> <br /> So why do people keep asking this question like it's an uncertain thing? Have we ever led anyone to think the outcome is in question?<br /> <br /> I'm seriously curious. I don't understand why this question keeps being asked practically every time, from people who've been with us long enough that I would think they'd know the answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honesty. Probably the excitment and the wonder and the tiny bit of worry. I mean your right, there really is no reason to ask the question. Especially as yes, such books have been made available for years, and i have some of them on my own shelf to prove it. <br /> <br /> I guess there is also the wish for an official answer and such. <br /> <br /> But for me, today, with it was mostly the happiness of having the Core and Aeon books in my hand. I didn't think, I felt! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T18:37:38-07:00","id":1344793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1344775#post1344775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can you help me? I'm wondering something.<br /> <br /> This is one of those questions I see a lot. From people who've been following us for years.<br /> <br /> I can't think of a single case in almost eight years where we A) released a PDF, and B) it's big enough (~50 pages) to turn into print-on-demand, where we <i>haven't</i> turned on that option.<br /> <br /> DriveThruRPG is our primary marketplace, so we're going to PoD everything we reasonably can.<br /> <br /> So why do people keep asking this question like it's an uncertain thing? Have we ever led anyone to think the outcome is in question?<br /> <br /> I'm seriously curious. I don't understand why this question keeps being asked practically every time, from people who've been with us long enough that I would think they'd know the answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because assumptions are generally a bad thing and y\u2019all have never made an explicit policy statement indicating that all your pdf products over X size will be available for PoD purchase every time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T05:29:54-07:00","id":1344905,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I didn't want to just assume it would happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T06:09:34-07:00","id":1344918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1344793#post1344793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> y\u2019all have never made an explicit policy statement indicating that all your pdf products over X size will be available for PoD purchase every time.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's been in <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/about/faq/\" target=\"_blank\">our site FAQ for years</a> -- which is linked at the bottom of every Kickstarter we do -- but no one looks there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T13:03:58-07:00","id":1345032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1344918#post1344918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's been in <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/about/faq/\" target=\"_blank\">our site FAQ for years</a> -- which is linked at the bottom of every Kickstarter we do -- but no one looks there.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's true, I never read the bottom of the kickstarter, because that's the &quot;Risks&quot; section, which is 99% of the time just statements about how unlikely it is that the Kickstarter will fail.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T15:05:48-07:00","id":1345071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1345032#post1345032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's true, I never read the bottom of the kickstarter, because that's the &quot;Risks&quot; section, which is 99% of the time just statements about how unlikely it is that the Kickstarter will fail.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Kickstarter is just one place that Ian mentioned is linked to our actual website FAQ where we make explicit policy statements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T15:05:35-07:00","id":1345335,"title":"","content":"*pokes head up* was this going to be in print form at some point (Aeon Expansion). I just got my Core and Aeon books in good order","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T15:24:17-07:00","id":1345339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1345335#post1345335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*pokes head up* was this going to be in print form at some point (Aeon Expansion). I just got my Core and Aeon books in good order</div> </div> </div> </div>Please read the previous nine posts before yours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T15:24:25-07:00","id":1345340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1345335#post1345335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*pokes head up* was this going to be in print form at some point (Aeon Expansion). I just got my Core and Aeon books in good order</div> </div> </div> </div>As was literally just repeatedly stated, every full OPP book gets POD treatment on Drivethru. Everyone. The ones that don\u2019t are the chapterlet PDFs that are too short, which this obviously isn\u2019t.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T15:38:17-07:00","id":1345343,"title":"","content":"Sorry. Been up since 0230hrs CST today<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-04T19:22:39-08:00","id":1346000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1344775#post1344775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can you help me? I'm wondering something.<br /> <br /> This is one of those questions I see a lot. From people who've been following us for years.<br /> <br /> I can't think of a single case in almost eight years where we A) released a PDF, and B) it's big enough (~50 pages) to turn into print-on-demand, where we <i>haven't</i> turned on that option.<br /> <br /> DriveThruRPG is our primary marketplace, so we're going to PoD everything we reasonably can.<br /> <br /> So why do people keep asking this question like it's an uncertain thing? Have we ever led anyone to think the outcome is in question?<br /> <br /> I'm seriously curious. I don't understand why this question keeps being asked practically every time, from people who've been with us long enough that I would think they'd know the answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because many of your customers are basically: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DqnIIkK8PuE\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DqnIIkK8PuE</a> who need constant reassurance about these things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-18T19:21:03-08:00","id":1349490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowstripe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1336491#post1336491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I read about Psiads, they only get 3 dots to divide between the 6 modes of their two Primary Aptitudes at character generation. The reason Psions get a 4th dot is because of the improvements the Prometheus Chambers provide. This is the same reason why Psiads do not get a bonus Attribute dot for their preferred Approach (and thus can't sacrifice it to start the game with Psi 3 like Psions can).<br /> <br /> One thing I am not clear on is how Quantakinesis works with Psiads. I know that once they reach Psi 3, they treat it as a 3rd Primary Aptitude, but it isn't clear if they can purchase Quantakinetic modes before then (though it is clearly stated that they can not choose Teleportation modes until Psi 3). Since Psions who specialize in either Quantakinesis or Teleportation need to be Psi 3 to do so, I am inclined towards the idea that Quantakinetic modes can't be obtained until Psi 3 for Psiads, just like Teleportation modes. I think this makes the most sense overall to be honest.<br /> <br /> As for the rest of the PDF, I am still working my way through much of it. Still, I am looking forward to getting a physical copy of this product once a PoD is available (PDFs are okay, but my computer isn't really portable to my games).</div> </div> </div> </div>Admittedly I'm late to this discussion. That said, the Attribute point being traded for Psi is the one from Step 6, Finishing Touches. The point is that Psions with an Auxiliary Mode from Quantakinesis or Teleportation (or who actually are Qs or Ts) were already strongly latent in those Aptitudes and <i>already had</i> a high enough Psi to support them. So, they don't get the extra Finishing Touch Attribute Point. However, since they went through the Prometheus Chamber and were &quot;genetically optimized,&quot; they do get the addition it provides to an Attribute that is part of their preferred Approach.<br /> <br /> In truth there's no reason why a Psiad (especially one from the Aeon era) couldn't also trade the Finishing Touch Attribute for an additional Psi point. The thing to recall is that each step takes place in a certain order. The Mode dots get assigned before the Finishing Touches. It's only at the Finishing Touches that the Psi would be raised. Thus, even with a Psi of 3, a Psiad could not obtain Quantakinesis modes until after play began.<br /> <br /> BTW, does anyone have any homebrew sheets for Psiads or Superiors from Aeon Expansion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 11-20-2019, 05:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T21:49:13-08:00","id":1349781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1349490#post1349490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Admittedly I'm late to this discussion. That said, the Attribute point being traded for Psi is the one from Step 6, Finishing Touches. The point is that Psions with an Auxiliary Mode from Quantakinesis or Teleportation (or who actually are Qs or Ts) were already strongly latent in those Aptitudes and <i>already had</i> a high enough Psi to support them. So, they don't get the extra Finishing Touch Attribute Point. However, since they went through the Prometheus Chamber and were &quot;genetically optimized,&quot; they do get the addition it provides to an Attribute that is part of their preferred Approach.<br /> <br /> In truth there's no reason why a Psiad (especially one from the Aeon era) couldn't also trade the Finishing Touch Attribute for an additional Psi point. The thing to recall is that each step takes place in a certain order. The Mode dots get assigned before the Finishing Touches. It's only at the Finishing Touches that the Psi would be raised. Thus, even with a Psi of 3, a Psiad could not obtained Quantakinesis or Teleportation modes until after play began.</div> </div> </div> </div>I use the same house rule in my games, the Psiads can trade a Attribute Point in Step 6 to a extra Psi Point.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1349490#post1349490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> BTW, does anyone have any homebrew sheets for Psiads or Superiors from Aeon Expansion?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am working in a new character to Psions and Psiads. When I finished this project, I will begin to create a superior character sheet.<br /> <br /> The old version, only to Psions: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NsEKpiuwA1t4G_mlEJBElvuikRyE0sEq/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NsE...ew?usp=sharing</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T15:50:17-08:00","id":1350143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shadowninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1335564-aeon-aexpansion?p=1349781#post1349781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I use the same house rule in my games, the Psiads can trade a Attribute Point in Step 6 to a extra Psi Point.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I am working in a new character to Psions and Psiads. When I finished this project, I will begin to create a superior character sheet.<br /> <br /> The old version, only to Psions: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NsEKpiuwA1t4G_mlEJBElvuikRyE0sEq/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NsE...ew?usp=sharing</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Given that this listed all the various modes for all the Psi Aptitudes, it fits the idea of a Psiad more.<br /> <br /> You might consider leaving the 1s and 0s off of the Paths so people can put it what they have as the raise them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}